msgstr "Scan or paste the instructor's code, then save the request on this device. It remains unconfirmed until the server receives and accepts it. A rotating QR code may expire before synchronization; ask the instructor to use the session's static QR code."

msgid "اسم الطالب الكامل أو الرقم الجامعي"
msgstr "Student full name or university ID"

