msgstr "This student and code have already been saved on this device."

msgid "وصلت الطلبات المحفوظة إلى الحد الآمن (500). اتصل بالشبكة لمزامنتها أولاً."
msgstr "The safe limit of 500 saved requests has been reached. Connect to the network and sync them first."

